window.products.push({"id":834179,"name":"Manual Coffee French Press Grinder: Hand Bean Mill with adjustable Stainless Steel Conical Burr, Small Portable, for Make Espresso, Pour Over AeroPres","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DNdc0GV6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"iZaili F18S Manual Coffee; Grinder! Your specialty coffee needs a professional grinder！ There's nothing like the fresh aroma of freshly ground coffee beans to start your day off right. Make just enough for each cup, and never have to worry about stale ground coffee again. FEATURES 1. Built-in roughness adjuster Use a steel ball to dampen the structures and adjust the coarseness point-by-point for precise grinding. 2. Sharp stainless steel burr The stainless steel burrs in this grinder are set to a hardness of HRC 55-58, so the beans are cut quickly and consistently. 3. Mini lightweight Only 7 inches (18 cm) high. Weight 1.26 Lb(570g), so it won't be a burden to carry around while traveling. FINE-TUNING Its fine-tuning mechanism moves the burr 2 mils per click, making it easier to find your espresso sweet spot. Clicks 06-12 Espresso Clicks 13-20 AeroPress Clicks 21-29 Pour-Over Clicks 30-39 French Press OPERATION GUIDE 1. Adjustment Direction Coarse Fine: Unscrew the powder receiver,hold the handle,turn the regulator to your desired grind fitness. turn clockwise for a finer grinder and counter-clockwise for coarse. 2. Take off the cover, put the coffee bean in the grinder (less than 25g each time) 3. Attach the cover. Hold the grinder firmly and turn the handle clockwise start to grind. 4. pouring out the coffee powder; GRINDER MAINTENACE 1.Clean it with the soft brush given; 2.Blow it with mini rubber air blower; 3.Wash it with clean water, then dry it quickly; 4.Wipe it with soft cloth. 5.Put it on the dry and clean place when you do not use it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DNdc0GV6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iZaili","source_asin":"B0B9LCSXLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9LCSXLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9LCSXLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":834180,"name":"The Museum Outlet - The Avenue in The Rain, 1917 v - Canvas (Medium)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nLoL5W+HL._AC_.jpg","description":"Produced on bright white, fine poly-cotton blend, matte canvas using the latest generation giclee technology. The quality of the giclee print rivals traditional silver-halide and gelatin printing processes and is commonly found in museums and art galleries in New York City at the Metropolitan Museum, the Museum of Modern Art, and the Chelsea Galleries. The giclee process involves the spraying of millions of ink droplets onto high quality paper. The smooth transitions of color gradients make giclee prints appear much more realistic than other prints. Although our reproductions come in standard sizes, they can be enlarged as per your requirement. However, please note that the dimensions of the length and breadth of the original will need to be maintained in the same ratio. Changing the ratios would result in either a skewed or cropped reproduction; neither of which are desirable or available. Our prints are rolled in a tube with the printed side facing outward. This helps to ensure that your prints are well packed and arrive at their destination without damage and in perfect condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nLoL5W+HL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Museum Outlet","source_asin":"B015SJ0Q6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015SJ0Q6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015SJ0Q6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
