window.products.push({"id":834395,"name":"Birds Beak Paring Knife, WELLSTAR 2.75 Inch Potato Tourne Peeling Knife, Super Sharp German Stainless Steel Forged Blade and Full Tang Handle for Frui","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zIS+aTX7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【RAZOR SHARP】12°degree angle per blade side makes this Tourne Paring knife extremely sharp. The extraordinarily super sharp blade was painstakingly honed by most experienced craftsmen. This Fruit Paring knife is great for fluting mushrooms or creating decorative fruit or vegetable garnishes and for prepping small, spherical fruits and vegetables. Super sharp edge will help lock the fruit and foods original flavors and nutrition 【GERMAN STAINLESS STEEL BLADE】Imported GERMAN Din1.4116 premium steel, incorporated with skillful craftsmen and ice-hardened heat treatment, all of these ensures this Bird’s Beak Paring knife with a high level of rust-resistance, wear-resistance and long-lasting performance. Hardness of the blade reaches to HRC 56 【DURABLE ONE PIECE CONSTRUCTION】This peeling knife was masterfully crafted from one solid piece of ultra-sturdy German Stainless Steel that runs from the tip of knife through the end of handle, this ensures no break or falling off of handle and provides the most strength and long-lasting durability. Hand wash is recommended for better protection on the blade to extend this fruit knife’s lifespan 【GREAT BALANCE, GIFT BOX PACKED】Finely balanced from the tip to the heel, complete with a full tang for the ultimate support and leverage. This helps provide you great comfort, remarkable control and unbelievable smooth cutting experience. This Paring knife is nicely packed with a beautiful GIFT BOX. This knife will be a wonderful gift for your wife, husband, mother, father and friends who like cooking 【CUSTOMER GUARANTEE-100% SATISFACTION】Lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects. For any question, we will provide you the satisfied solution. This makes your purchase absolutely risk-free and you can enjoy testing our quality and durability. Purchase this knife for fruits today while stocks last by clicking \"Add to Cart\" above","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zIS+aTX7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WELLSTAR","source_asin":"B07YR9RJ1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YR9RJ1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YR9RJ1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
