window.products.push({"id":834452,"name":"ACCUMTEK Extra Soft Light Grey Bathroom Rugs and Mats Set 2 Pieces Bathroom Rug Set Light Gray, Thick Chenille Bath Rugs Non Slip, Absorbent Plush Sha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lSgU8URoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤SUPERIOR FLUFFY SOFT: 1 Large Bath Rug 20\"x32\", 1 Small Bath Rug 17\"x24\". Different from the normal chenille bath rug, our bath mat set is crafted from thick and velvety microfiber chenille with bold pop stripes pattern lends, exquisitely soft and cozy like a comfortable quilt protector for your feet. The unique design especially suited to serve as a backdrop to more brightly colored décor, which create a interesting and fantastic atmosphere for your family. ❤INCREDIBLY ABSORBENT: The thick pile bath mat is much more absorbent than cotton bath rugs. High-pile chenille fabric helps save your floors from dripping water while you’re stepping out of the bath, shower, spa, or getting ready by the sink. The microfiber shag toilet mat will dry quickly so you won’t need to worry about moldy messes or odor. ❤STRONG NON-SLIP BACKING: Skid resistant bottom is made of high quality PVC material, which is much stronger and durable for long lasting use. It won’t rip, tear, or break down, even after prolonged usage. This anti-skid backing keeps bathroom mat staying in place firmly to prevent shifting and skidding, the bath mat would stay where you want it to be. Please place the non-skid toilet rug on DRY SMOOTH FLOOR only. ❤MULTI PURPOSE USE: The toilet rug available in a wide variety of both playful and neutral colors, it is an essential for any style space, making it ideal for your entryway, kitchen, bedroom, living room, garage, pet room, lobby, stairs, balcony, laundry room, bathroom, tub or shower. ❤MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine wash the bath carpet separately in cold water using mild detergent. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry on low setting and shake to restore fluff. Or Simply pick up and shake rug to freshen and give chenille pile new life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lSgU8URoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACCUMTEK","source_asin":"B08DVCZD2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DVCZD2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DVCZD2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
