window.products.push({"id":834606,"name":"lixinhu Electric Wine Opener ,Reusable Corkscrew Gift Set with Foil Cutter, Vacuum Stoppers, Aerator and Pourer Set for Kitchen Bar Restaurant Black 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qUZUKY46L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Operating Instruction: Open the battery compartment cover and put 4 \"AA\" batteries into compartment by match \"+\" and\"-\" marks on the battery and compartment.  Use the foil cutter to remove any foil seal covering the cork before removing the cork Place the wine opener on top of a wine bottle vertically Hold the electric wine opener firmly and press the lower part of the switch. The corkscrew spiral will turn in a clockwise direction and enter the cork and then gradually pull cork out of bottle. Lift the electric wine bottle opener away from the bottle. Remove the cork by pressing the upper part of the switch and the spiral will turn in the counter-clockwise direction and release the cork. Attach the wine pourer to bottle and reduce drips and spills while pouring.  The double air intake system makes wine releasing more flavors and aromas.  Insert the universal wine stopper into the bottle and pump for several times if there is wine left in bottle.  Precautions Keep it away from children to avoid any hurt Do not put your finger into hole of corkscrew in any case, it may cause serious injury Do not put electric wine opener in water or other liquid 4 \"AA\" batteries not included. Read the user manual carefully before using Package Included:  1x Electric Wine Bottle Opener. 1X Wine Pourer. 1x Foil cutter. 1x Vacuum Wine Bottle Stopper. 1x Instruction Manua.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qUZUKY46L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lixinhu","source_asin":"B099PSD9X7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099PSD9X7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099PSD9X7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":834607,"name":"Home Decorators Collection Picardy Area Rug, 7'10x11'1\", Teal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617FwFmY44L._AC_.jpg","description":"Inspired by rich tapestries, our Picardy Area Rug would be at home in a lavish living room...but this gorgeous traditional rug is built to endure the outdoors. Intricate botanical motifs fill the field and scroll along the edge of this border rug, creating an elaborate feast for the eyes. Try this jacquard-woven outdoor rug in the sunroom, on your deck or even in the dining room. Machine woven on a jacquard loom. 2mm pile height. Can be used indoors or out. Durable and easy to clean. Part of the Somerset Collection. Actual size is 7'10x11'1\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617FwFmY44L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Decorators Collection","source_asin":"B00TIRN7BA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TIRN7BA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TIRN7BA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":834608,"name":"Ameridown Elite Medium 600 Fill Power Down Pillow, Ideal Support for Back Sleepers, Queen Size, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SO69vPfpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We spend about one-third of our lives sleeping, it's important to settle for nothing less than perfect when it comes to you and your bedding—which is why we created our AmeriDown Pillows. Your sleep position will determine the level of firmness required to properly support and align your head, neck and shoulders allowing you to sleep comfortably. Ultra-soft and plush, our pillows provide the ultimate sleeping experience with our standard, queen, and king-sized down pillows that come in soft, medium, and firm fill. We recommend a soft pillow for stomach sleepers, a medium pillow for back sleepers, and a firm pillow for side sleepers. Crafted with only high-quality materials, our pillows are made with a 245 thread count brushed cotton twill shell that has been certified to the Standard 100 by Oeko-Tex**, so you can enjoy a pillow that will last for years. Plus, the irritant-free 600 fill power down provides lightweight and airy comfort is RDS certified***. We make our bedding products right here in the USA*, so we can ensure their superior craftsmanship. Our pillows feature double needle stitching that provides a stronger seam and also helps to prevent the down fill from escaping. The corded trim adds durability to the seams, which are typically high stress areas. Make sure you cover your AmeriDown Pillow with a protective case and fluff regularly so you can enjoy a great night’s sleep, every night. *Made in a La Crosse, WI, USA manufacturing facility **Oeko-Tex Certified, 3.8.21 ***Responsible Down Standard Certified with scope certificate CU 843297RDS, 2.23.2022","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SO69vPfpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ameridown","source_asin":"B092FZ8N34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092FZ8N34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092FZ8N34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
