window.products.push({"id":834831,"name":"Riedel Veritas Shiraz Wine Glass, 約口径68×95×246Hmm, Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51isKyTgo0L._AC_SL1261_.jpg","description":"The unadorned machine-made new world Shiraz glass of the light-weight glass collection Riedel Veritas impresses with its delicate shape and excels through its focus on new world wines. The shape of the glass optimal delivers the classic aromas of toast and black olives, which are typical for wines made of Shiraz grapes. On the palate, it brings out the wine's silky, velvety structure and balanced flavors. The tannins melt into the fruit, appearing sweet rather than acerbic on the back palate. The Riedel Veritas bowls are based on the DNA of grape varietals and differentiates for the first time between \"new world\" and \"old world\" within one glass collection. Riedel Veritas combines the charm of a handmade glass with the consistent accuracy only a machine made glass can achieve. All Riedel glasses are dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51isKyTgo0L._AC_SL1261_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riedel","source_asin":"B07NHR9BNT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NHR9BNT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NHR9BNT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
