window.products.push({"id":834858,"name":"Brown Tea Infuser Water Bottle 18.5oz, Loose Leaf Tea, Tea Bottle, Glass Water Bottle, Glass Tea Infuser, Tea Infuser Bottle, Tea infuser Cup, Glass W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FrIXhJ3QL._AC_.jpg","description":"This reusable, portable tea infuser water bottle is an excellent addition to your lunch box. It allows you to take your favourite teas with you whenever you are on the go. It can be brewed with hot or cold water; it's entirely up to you. The infuser is located at the bottom of the bottle to ensure that the infusion continues throughout the day, allowing you to have better and stronger tea. The glass is of premium quality, and the bottle features a wrist strap to allow you to carry your drink around even when it's hot. Details ENJOY TEA ANYWHERE - take your tea in your bottle with youPREMIUM FEEL GLASS - high-quality glass to give you a premium look and feelEASY TO CLEAN - opens from both ends to make cleaning a breezeINFUSE FROM THE BOTTOM - ensures that the tea is infused evenlyCARRY STRAP INCLUDED - to carry your tea when it's hot or coldPREMIUM SILICON - to make holding and opening a breezeTHIS IS THE TEA INFUSER FOR WINNERS - don't miss this deal PERFECT FOR LOOSE LEAF TEA - The bottom infusion holds loose leaf tea for infusion","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FrIXhJ3QL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B1CCJ9TQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1CCJ9TQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1CCJ9TQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":834859,"name":"Sealy Posturepedic Hybrid Copper Plush Mattress, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oWSHgj4TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enhance your sleep experience with cutting edge technology with the Sealy Posturepedic Hybrid Copper Plush mattress. This half foam and half springs mattress combines body-conforming comfort with all-over support so you can relax and sleep well. The Copper Plush is a tight top mattress providing a thick, flat layer of upholstery for a soft touch. The tight top gives you durability and body support, preventing lasting impressions in the mattress. This mattress is covered in premium stretch cover fabric with soft-spun yarn and a gentle memory foam underneath. The side panels along the edge of the mattress help create a breathable border fabric that allows more airflow to help keep you more comfortable during the night. The Posturepedic Hybrid Copper Plush Mattress utilizes the Zone Sealy Embrace Coil, the premium version of the specially engineered encased coil system used for even more precise and exceptional support. The encasing allows each of the coils to move independently, for more targeted support and reduced motion transfer. There are nearly 20% more coils throughout the mattress to respond to the natural curves and alignment of your spine, for exceptional full-body support. The Copper Hybrid mattress incorporates the Solid Edge HD Premier System at a wider edge of 3 inches around the mattress so you can use the full surface of the mattress, as well as utilize the solid seating surface. The Sealy Posturepedic Hybrid Copper Plush mattress is backed by a 10-year limited warranty. The Queen dimensions are 79\" L x 60\" W x 9\" H. At Sealy, every mattress is designed and built right here in the USA with quality materials. With over a century of experience, you can rest assured knowing your Sealy will feel good for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oWSHgj4TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sealy","source_asin":"B01M6V27B6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M6V27B6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M6V27B6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
