window.products.push({"id":834973,"name":"Small Vintage 3x3 Round Picture Frame, Mini Antique Ornate Circle Photo Frame, Table Top Display and Wall Hanging Home Decor, Old Fashioned Photo Gall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GBGnrNtjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT VINTAGE DESIGN: The antique distressed brown picture frame 3x3 with artistic Victorian embellishment perfectly showcases your favorite pictures, portrait or art prints. Fits great for any older family photos. It appears aged and antique. The small vintage round picture frame 3 by 3 is an ideal choice to display your precious memories in your life, and brings extra old-world charm to your home. EXCELENT QUALITY: The mini antique looking circle frame is sturdy and well made. It is heavy duty of great value. The lovely retro frame is made of environmental resin, including black velvet backing. The cute frame comes with a solid easel back for table top display and a hook for the option to hang on the wall. Real glass front gives a clear view of your picture and preserves the life of your photo. ATTRACTIVE LOOK: The beautiful tiny frame is hand crafted in gorgeous dark brown color. It looks warm and appealing. Special vintage round appearance with perfect details. Outline border dimensions are 4.6x5.2 inch and made to display a 3x3 inch circular photo. It will light your home and make your room look more like a work of art. TABLETOP DISPLAY AND WALL DECOR: This timeless and classy picture frame 3”x3” stands up wonderfully, and really dresses up the table. It also hangs up vertically, adds a sense of luxury to a gallery wall. This unique little frame looks great in the living room, kitchen, dining room. It can be placed just about anywhere, from your home to your office, studio or gallery. IDEAL GIFTS: The ornate old fashioned picture frame is a perfect gift for your family, friends, relatives, and someone you love. Makes a great gift idea for multiple occasions: wedding, anniversary, housewarming, birthday, Father’s Day, Mother’s Day, baby showers, Christmas and family events. This fancy frame delightfully combines sentimental value, practical use, and decorative splendor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GBGnrNtjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SYLVIA'S SHOP","source_asin":"B09ZYC15L8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-834973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZYC15L8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZYC15L8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
